-
-| red | cause class | analysis |
-|---|---|---|
-| `glibc_gottpoff` (rc=1) | lccc-only TLS `@gottpoff` linker path | pre-existing; lccc-only test (`LCCC_NO_COMPARE`); unrelated to this area |
