-## Remaining gaps vs GCC (25 vs 74)
-
-GCC inner loop (from godbolt):
-
-```
-vbroadcastsd (%rdi), %ymm2
-vbroadcastsd 8(%rdi), %ymm1
-.L3:
-  vmovapd (%rcx,%rax), %ymm0
-  vfmadd213pd (%rdx,%rax), %ymm2, %ymm0
