-# FOLLOWUP 2026-09-02c — MachInst typed scalar-float layer (FMov/FAlu) + vectorizer-orphan ICE fix
-
-Base: `10386f4` (origin/main). Session snapshots: **S07-typed-float-layer**, **S08-vec-dce-ice-fix**, S09 (this doc).
