-## 5. Code-size cost of the liveness fix (sqlite3.c, 250 kLOC)
-
-| config | `.text` bytes | instructions |
-|---|---:|---:|
-| before `-O1` | 1 408 059 | 400 113 |
-| after  `-O1` | 1 410 939 (+0.20 %) | 400 849 (+0.18 %) |
-| before `-O2` | 1 448 331 | 409 538 |
