+## 09-02 — general-cloner revival: the cloner that could never fire
+<!-- src: engineering/FOLLOWUP-2026-09-02-general-cloner-revival.md -->
+
+Audit of the c72ff2c review: stride scaling existed but the general CFG
+cloner could not fire on *any* standard loop — the `inst_ok` pointer-
+origin walk failed **closed** at depth 8 spinning `phi → Add → phi`
+through the IV cycle, so every loop died at the check (instrumented:
