+condition block. Fix: an operand-availability gate (outside values pass
+through; inside values get their pure def chain re-materialized —
+never div/rem; everything else declines, scalar stays byte-exact).
+`k_inplace_three` now vectorizes fully (32-wide AVX2) instead of
+crashing. **S10 IV-live-out (pre-existing, fixed).** `wsum` got the
+vector iteration count (15) instead of the trip count (511): the map
+and stencil transforms redefine the scalar counter per vector iteration
+but never called `rewire_escaping_iv_uses` — the reduction paths
+already did. Fix generalizes the rewire (any IV + pass tag, also
+`Store.ptr`), retargets exit-phi loop-side incomings at the remainder
+header, and gates both analyzers with `loop_escape_closed`. Zero-cost:
+loops stay vectorized. **S08-loop-idiom v1.1** is an opt-in pass whose
+measured reach is near zero (lz4 hot loops are single-block /
+pointer-IV / param-rooted); the extension order is single-block loops →
+pointer-IV (`Ult` on pointer phis, trip = `end − start`) → preheader
+splitting → `__restrict__` param roots (unlocks libc-style copies); the
+match-copy smear case must **never** match. Flip default-on only after
+corpus A/B + fuzz on the final guard set. Live items are in
+[`../../backlog.md`](../../backlog.md) PF-LZ4-1 / S08-next. [fix][rec]
