+
+| File | Window | Source lineage |
+|------|--------|----------------|
+| [`2026-08.md`](2026-08.md) | 2026-08-18..08-31 | boot-quest start, matmul trilogy, SCCP adoption, IR-verifier birth, Regehr corpus |
