-* **Useful flags/env found the hard way**: there is no `-emit-mir`/`--mir-dump-dir` in this build. IR
-  dumps are `CCC_DUMP_IR_AFTER=1` (after *all* IR passes, Debug format) and `CCC_DUMP_EACH_PASS=1`
